              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MikeLikestoEat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it exactly as directed, but cut up the pieces into \"salsa-sized\" so I could eat it as a dip rather than salad. Very good that day, much better the next day. Next time I will add a fair amount of crushed garlic. I think that will make it 5 stars.",
            "datePublished": "2012-06-09T08:37:08.617Z"
          },
          {
