            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cindy mack"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made it and liked it. I never make a recipe exactly as it is written. I added feta, basil (because that was the fresh herb that I had)instead of cilantro, lemon instead of lime to go with the basil, and a bit of Italian Dressing. I sat it in the fridge for 30 minutes.",
