              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NYDadCook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely delicious and refreshing! I am not a fan of raw tomatoes but had all of these ingredients on hand. I used juice of 2 limes, added a couple TB of Italian vinaigrette and feta.",
            "datePublished": "2012-09-11T07:13:30.763Z"
